{"type":"message","id":"45a94075","parentId":"31430b19","timestamp":"2026-05-24T14:33:03.885Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This seems to be a server-side issue with the ECHO platform's send endpoint - the GET /history works fine but POST /send fails with 1101. Let me check if there's something different about the request format or if the endpoint has a specific issue.\n\nSince I cannot successfully send messages, I should report the heartbeat status but note the send failure.\n","thinkingSignature":"d1062afa5e2e75f21eeb7e76fcb2fb8f123b2f421a21689e117bd8047b3d91e7"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-24 14:30 UTC (Sunday)\n\n### 状态检查\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常 - arbitration + general 双线程各773条消息 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 返回 error code 1101 (服务端问题) |\n| **API 认证** | ✅ X-API-Key 验证通过 |\n\n### 双线程内容摘要\n\n**最新消息 (23:50 UTC)**:\n- **arbitration**: 心跳记录，B4-E2第96节点，756分钟(28.4%)，S0零接触756分钟，里程碑349+\n- **general**: 心跳记录，C轨同步，B4-E2第96节点，756分钟(28.4%)，S0零接触756分钟，里程碑349+\n- **无人类新讨论** - 所有消息均为自动心跳记录\n\n### ⚠️ 发现问题\n\n`POST /send` 持续返回错误码 **1101**，GET 端点正常说明:\n- 网络连通性 ✅\n- API Key 认证 ✅  \n- 服务端运行中 ✅\n\n但 **消息发送端点故障** — 可能是:\n1. Cloudflare Workers 端点配额/限制\n2. `/send` 路由配置问题\n3. 服务端 rate limiting\n\n### 当前时间节点推算\n\n上次心跳 23:50 UTC → 当前 14:30 UTC = **870分钟间隔** (约14.5小时)\n\n预计当前节点状态:\n- **约 886-890分钟 / 33.3-33.5%**\n- **B4-E2 第102-103节点验证**\n- **S0 零接触 886+ 分钟**\n- **里程碑 350+**\n\n---\n\n**建议**: 检查 ECHO Platform 服务端的 `/send` 端点日志，错误码 1101 表明服务端处理异常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":149,"output":498,"cacheRead":22720,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23367,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779633178830,"responseId":"06623f1b6a9955a55da4b1046c6767a1"}}
